   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi 昌錦,<div><br></div><div>參考以下建議:</div><div><br></div><div>1. 建議將檔案以 CSV 方式儲存後, 再使用 read,table / read.csv  匯入至R, 不要直接匯入 Excel 檔案.</div><div>2. 圖中有 \\n 之換行符號, 因此使用 strsplit 時, 須使用 \\\\n 參數(即多加上1個\\)</div><div>3. lapply(area , &quot;[[&quot;, 1) 可取出 list物件 area 的每個元素中第1個 index 資料.</div><div>4. lapply(area , &quot;[[&quot;, 2) 可取出 list物件 area 的每個元素中第2個 index 資料.<br></div><div>5. 如果有R讀取中文檔案產生亂碼等錯誤問題, 請參考 <a href=\"http://rwepa.blogspot.tw/2017/09/ansifileencoding.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://rwepa.blogspot.tw/2017/09/ansifileencoding.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237568106000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3gEYR4-S3gpDRO1-uHuWyo\">http://rwepa.blogspot.tw/2017/09/ansifileencoding.html</a></div><div><br></div><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-3P1ZQ466OX4/WdTs_UU1_gI/AAAAAAAAL9o/6BvAxHxlGF4QziezhRzUd6EFAwWVk8-MACLcBGAs/s1600/%25E6%25AC%2584%25E4%25BD%258D%25E8%25B3%2587%25E6%2596%2599%25E8%2599%2595%25E7%2590%2586.png\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-3P1ZQ466OX4/WdTs_UU1_gI/AAAAAAAAL9o/6BvAxHxlGF4QziezhRzUd6EFAwWVk8-MACLcBGAs/s1600/%2525E6%2525AC%252584%2525E4%2525BD%25258D%2525E8%2525B3%252587%2525E6%252596%252599%2525E8%252599%252595%2525E7%252590%252586.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237568106000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0VDI6I_zu2kGEYIN3QURwW\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-3P1ZQ466OX4/WdTs_UU1_gI/AAAAAAAAL9o/6BvAxHxlGF4QziezhRzUd6EFAwWVk8-MACLcBGAs/s1600/%25E6%25AC%2584%25E4%25BD%258D%25E8%25B3%2587%25E6%2596%2599%25E8%2599%2595%25E7%2590%2586.png\" border=\"0\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><br></p><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><font color=\"#666600\"><div><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"># title: 欄位資料處理<br></span># date: 2017.10.4</div><div>X__1 &lt;- c(&quot;觀 光 遊 憩 區\\nScenic Spots&quot;, &quot;東北角暨宜蘭海岸國家風景區\\nNortheaset and Yilan C&gt;&quot;, &quot;鼻頭港服務區\\nBitou Harbor Service Area&quot;)</div><div>X__2 &lt;- c(&quot;縣 市 別\\nLocation&quot;, &quot;NA&quot;, &quot;新北市 New Taipei City&quot;)</div><div>(mydf &lt;- data.frame(X__1, X__2, stringsAsFactors=FALSE))</div><div><br></div><div>area &lt;- strsplit(mydf$X__1, &quot;\\\\n&quot;)</div><div><br></div><div>mydf$風景區_中文 &lt;- lapply(area , &quot;[[&quot;, 1)</div><div>mydf$風景區_英文 &lt;- lapply(area , &quot;[[&quot;, 2)</div><div><br></div><div>mydf</div><div>mydf &lt;- mydf[c(3,4,2)]</div><div>mydf<br># end</div></font></div></code></div><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><br></p><div>鍾昌錦於 2017年10月4日星期三 UTC+8下午8時46分21秒寫道：</div></div>"
    ],
